From 93010d32589b89d21b9640df0bf14be08c2d339a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:50:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 44/61] Victory Road VS Seeker rematches

All 12 Victory Road trainers get rematch teams 8 levels higher (evolved
where the level allows, without duplicating a team member) in unused RS
trainer slots; the VS Seeker now works on Victory Road's three floors.
Generated by tools/hack/vr_rematches.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
---
 HACK_NOTES.md                        |   5 +
 data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc |  14 ++
 data/maps/VictoryRoad_2F/scripts.inc |  35 ++++
 data/maps/VictoryRoad_3F/scripts.inc |  42 ++++
 include/constants/opponents.h        |  14 ++
 src/data/trainer_parties.h           | 298 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/data/trainers.h                  | 160 +++++++-------
 src/item_use.c                       |  15 +-
 src/vs_seeker.c                      |  25 +++
 tools/hack/vr_rematches.py           | 130 ++++++++++++
 10 files changed, 657 insertions(+), 81 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tools/hack/vr_rematches.py

diff --git a/HACK_NOTES.md b/HACK_NOTES.md
index 9d67f6c..53afbb5 100644
--- a/HACK_NOTES.md
+++ b/HACK_NOTES.md
@@ -382,6 +382,10 @@ How the cap works with each way of gaining levels:
 - Wild Pokémon on Route 23, in Victory Road and in Cerulean Cave are also
   1.15x higher (Victory Road now reaches Lv. 55), so there's somewhere worth
   training before the Elite Four.
+- **Victory Road rematches:** the VS Seeker now works in Victory Road, and
+  all 12 of its trainers have rematch teams 8 levels higher (Lv. 54–63, evolved
+  where the level allows). Like other VS Seeker rematches, you can fight them
+  again each time the battery recharges (100 steps).
 - Regular trainers have at least ~18 IVs. The Elite Four, Champion, Rival and Giovanni have max IVs.
 - Every trainer uses the smart battle AI.
 - From Lt. Surge on, the Gym Leaders, Elite Four and Champion use some of
@@ -453,6 +457,7 @@ Each script runs once against the original pret data:
   an unused species slot, with its graphics, cry, Pokédex entry and evolution item.
 - `balance.py`: modern boss movesets, peak teams with the later evolutions.
 - `validate.py`: checks the game data for missing or inconsistent entries.
+- `vr_rematches.py`: the Victory Road VS Seeker rematch teams and scripts.
 - `exp_budget.py`: how much trainer Exp. each stretch of the game gives, and
   where that leaves a team against each level cap.
 - `save_check.py REF`: checks whether saves from an older release (a git ref)
